---
// Head, interests, publications, in progress, then talks & posters beside collaborators (Research.dc.html).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import Interests from '../components/research/Interests.astro';
import Publications from '../components/research/Publications.astro';
import InProgress from '../components/research/InProgress.astro';
import TalksCollaborators from '../components/research/TalksCollaborators.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Research"
  description="At BARTA Research Lab, IIT, University of Dhaka, I work on NLP, large language models and AI agents."
  active="research"
>
  <main>
    <PageHead slug="research" title="Research" ghost="inference">
      At <span class="ph-em">BARTA Research Lab</span>, IIT, University of Dhaka, I work on NLP, large language models and AI agents: LLM-based analysis of health discussions on social media, cross-lingual evaluation of LLM agents in Bangla, and, for my M.Sc. thesis, adaptive inference for efficient LLMs.
    </PageHead>
    <div class="container">
      <Interests />
      <Publications />
      <InProgress />
      <TalksCollaborators />
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
